WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.180
[Motorcycle engine revs and wind builds.]

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:03.150
[Suspension thumps over the uneven road.]

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.180
[Engine and wind continue with intermittent road impacts.]

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.500
[The engine slows and soft tones mark arrival.]
